  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusive Yemeni-Yemeni dialogue</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This 12-months measure will support inclusive and participatory Yemeni-Yemeni dialogue involving participants from all main groups in Yemeni society, notably women, youth, civil society actors, mediators and journalists as well as all political parties. The aim of this dialogue, which will gravitate around the 2023 Yemen International Forum in The Hague, is to facilitate discussions on potential ways forward and on agreements that can assist in avoiding a return to full-scale conflict and thereby mitigate the impact of the conflict on civilians. The action will be implemented in close cooperation with EU Member States which are supporting Yemeni-Yemeni dialogue and it will complement other EU support in the field of mediation and peacebuilding in Yemen.</narrative>
  </description>
